OL,3,GNEWSAChef jailed after filming attack
OL,4,Aon ex-partner
OL,5,
OL,6,FA chef who threatened to decapitate his
OL,7,Fex-partner in a "prolonged and vicious"
OL,8,Fattack, which he filmed on his mobile
OL,9,Fphone, has been jailed.
OL,11,FDavid Thompson, 49, burst into the
OL,12,Fvictim's flat in Harrogate while she
OL,13,Fwas watching television, before
OL,14,Fstamping on her, hitting her with a
OL,15,Fstereo unit and smashing a glass vase
OL,16,Fover her head.
OL,18,FYork Crown Court was told the woman,
OL,19,Fwho said she had feared she was going
OL,20,Fto die, suffered extensive bruising and
OL,21,Fcuts to her hand and knee, caused by
OL,22,Fshards from the glass.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
